      "content": "wait but im so far from a hospital and it's like 2am... i really dont want to deal with the ER if i dont have to. the drops i have are just organic chamomile and aloe, they're super soothing right? wouldn't that help calm the chemical burn better than just water? i feel like the water is just going to make it sting more if it's already burning.",
